+with compact tests, so the local positive Radon measures glue.
+
+The same reasoning works for a finite tuple of metrized actual bundles
+with individual unit frame terms. Generated reference floors transform
+as metric maxima under the SAME unit term. Bounded strict-winning
+locality and reference-floor independence in117 then preserve the
+unbounded nonpluripolar local products under the frame change. For a
+weighted local raw test the fixed harmonic term is continuous on the
+test support and passes by ordinary weak convergence; its potential
+term passes by the genuine weighted theorem with the required pairing
+sign. This verifies frame compatibility for the actual original
